B.a_V=new A.ff("This one is closed. If it comes back, write a new message and it will arrive with everything about your account attached again.",null)
B.a_W=new A.ff("If this is about somebody's safety and it is more than you should be handling alone, tell FCL \u2014 Profile > Talk to FCL. Closing it here does not send it on.",null)
B.a_X=new A.ff("The end date starts the clock. Results are public for a year afterwards; then only the winner stays public and the full record belongs to the people who were there.",null)
B.a_Y=new A.ff("Buying is not open yet. Everything on this page is real \u2014 what you hold, what each tier does, codes and credits \u2014 and nothing here can charge anybody.",null)
B.a_Z=new A.ff("This removes them and sends a report to FCL staff. Unlike an ordinary removal, it counts toward a review of their account \u2014 three reported removals, from three different leagues and three different admins, and the account is suspended pending a look by a person.",null)
B.a0_=new A.ff("Codes get replaced when a league retires an old one, and every link made with the old code stops working at that moment. That is deliberate \u2014 it is what makes a leaked invitation recoverable.",null)
B.a00=new A.ff("The start date also sets the refund deadlines: full refund until a week before, a tournament credit until the day before, and nothing inside twenty-four hours.",null)
